 ],"rep_takeaway":"When you call a deal 'clean,' check your open promises first. On Fetchwell, the Venmo answer and the saved-card reference you owed Daniel were still outstanding, and his engineer carried that doubt into kickoff. Close those loops before signature. And since a weekend sandbox build won this, make getting a customer engineer into the sandbox a deliberate step instead of something you hear about afterwards."},
